false}],"minimum":"","price":{"new":"","old":"","single":"15,500৳","tax":"Ex Tax: 15,500৳","discounts":[]},"request":false,"askText":"","stepperHidden":false,"productId":"221","features":{"title":"Key Features","items":[{"h":"Model: MR-UF2000","c":[]},{"h":"Load Capacity: 2000VA / 1200W","c":[]},{"h":"Battery Type &amp; Number : 2*12V/9Ah","c":[]},{"h":"Topology: Line-Interactive, Body: Metal Housing","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty : 2 Year (1 Year for Battery) (Box Mandatory While Claiming)","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p></p><h2>Marsiva MR-UF2000 2000VA Smart Line-Interactive UPS</h2><p></p><p>The Marsiva MR-UF2000 2000VA Smart Line-Interactive UPS is a powerful and intelligent power backup solution, ideal for home, office, and small business environments. With a robust 2000VA / 1200W capacity, it delivers stable and uninterrupted power to computers, servers, routers, and other critical electronics.</p><p>Engineered with Smart Line-Interactive technology and Automatic Voltage Regulation (AVR), the MR-UF2000 instantly corrects voltage fluctuations without switching to battery power—ensuring longer battery life and greater efficiency. It offers a simulated sine wave output, cold start function, and off-mode charging, making it a reliable and flexible choice for demanding setups.</p><p>Equipped with advanced safety features like overload, short circuit, and overcharge protection, as well as easy-to-read LED indicators and audible alarms, this UPS ensures total peace of mind. Compact and durable, it's built to deliver maximum uptime and device protection.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li>2000VA / 1200W high power capacity</li><li>Smart Line-Interactive UPS with AVR</li><li>Simulated sine wave output for safe device compatibility</li><li>12V high-capacity battery 9Ah</li><li>Cold start &amp; intelligent off-mode charging</li><li>Short circuit, overload, and overcharge protection</li><li>LED indicators and audible alarms for real-time status</li><li>Ideal for PCs, servers, networking gear, and home entertainment systems</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Must EW2110-1200 1200VA Line Interactive Offline UPS","href":"/must-ew2110-1200-1200va-line-interactive-offline-ups","now":"7,400৳","old":"8,300৳","single":""},{"name":"Marsiva MR-UF800 800VA Smart Line Interactive UPS","href":"/marsiva-mr-uf800-80va-offline-ups","now":"","old":"","single":"5,200৳"},{"name":"Marsiva MR-UF650 650VA Smart Line Interactive UPS","href":"/marsiva-mr-uf650-650va-offline-ups","now":"","old":"","single":"4,200৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":{"title":"From Same Brand","items":[{"href":"/marsiva-mr-uf1200-1200va-smart-line-interactive-ups","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Marsiva/MR-UF1200/MR-UF1200-500x-(2)-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"Marsiva MR-UF1200 1200VA Smart Line-Interactive UPS","width":100,"height":100},"name":"Marsiva MR-UF1200 1200VA Smart Line-Interactive UPS","now":"","old":"","single":"7,900৳","tax":"Ex Tax:7,900৳","out":true},{"href":"/marsiva-mr-uf3000-3000va-smart-line-interactive-ups","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Marsiva/mr-uf3000/UF2000-500x(2)-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"Marsiva MR-UF3000 3000VA Smart Line-Interactive UPS","width":100,"height":100},"name":"Marsiva MR-UF3000 3000VA Smart Line-Interactive UPS","now":"","old":"","single":"27,000৳","tax":"Ex Tax:27,000৳","out":true},{"href":"/marsiva-mr-uf650-650va-offline-ups","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Marsiva/MR-UF650/MR-UF650-500x500-1-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"Marsiva MR-UF650 650VA Smart Line Interactive UPS","width":100,"height":100},"name":"Marsiva MR-UF650 650VA Smart